        <mxCell id="note" parent="ln4" style="text;html=1;fontFamily=Comic Sans MS;fontStyle=2;fontSize=10;align=left;strokeColor=#000000;fontColor=#000000;" value="Why this matters: doing this automatically means no officer has to watch the rivers all day — people downstream still get 1–2 hours of warning. Checking the AI&#39;s confidence, and not repeating the same warning too soon, keeps people from being flooded with alerts." vertex="1">
